OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CMurdered woman's father welcomes new   
OL,5,Cstalking law                           
OL,6,GThe founder of a charity set up after  
OL,7,Ghis daughter was murdered by an ex-    
OL,8,Gboyfriend has reacted to a new         
OL,9,Gstandalone stalking offence being      
OL,10,Gcreated.                               
OL,12,FCurrently, the offences of stalking    
OL,13,Fand harassment are different, with the 
OL,14,Fonus on victims to prove that fear or  
OL,15,Fdistress has been caused. They will    
OL,16,Fnow be streamlined into one offence.   
OL,18,FNick Gazzard, whose daughter Hollie    
OL,19,Fdied in 2014 after being stalked and   
OL,20,Fsubsequently killed by an ex-partner,  
OL,21,Ffounded the Gloucestershire-based      
OL,22,FHollie Gazzard Trust.             G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
