OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CMurdered dog walker in 'wrong place,   
OL,5,Cat wrong time'                         
OL,6,GPolice say a military veteran who was  
OL,7,Gfound dead in woodland was "just in    
OL,8,Gthe wrong place at the wrong time"     
OL,9,Gwhen he was violently attacked.        
OL,11,FGraham Pennycook, 64, is believed to   
OL,12,Fhave been assaulted in the woods next  
OL,13,Fto Pernham Down polo field near        
OL,14,FLudgershall, Wiltshire, while walking  
OL,15,Fhis dog on 24 September.               
OL,17,FTwo months later, Wiltshire Police     
OL,18,Fhave not arrested anyone and are still 
OL,19,Fappealing to the public to help        
OL,20,Fidentify any suspects, despite         
OL,21,Fknocking on 1,200 doors and gathering  
OL,22,Fmore than 1,000 hours of footage. G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
