OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,.,,-,.-/.-//,,.,.,.-//
OL,4,CTurkey and tinsel trips boost seaside  
OL,5,Ceconomies                              
OL,6,GCoach trippers visiting the South West 
OL,7,Gto stay in hotels for Christmas themed 
OL,8,Gbreaks in November and December        
OL,9,Gcontribute millions to the local       
OL,10,Geconomy.                               
OL,12,FSo-called tinsel and turkey holidays   
OL,13,Fhave been running for decades,         
OL,14,Fbringing much needed income to the     
OL,15,Fhospitality sector at what can be a    
OL,16,Fquiet time of year.                    
OL,18,FThe English Riviera Bid company says   
OL,19,Fduring November and December, 400,000  
OL,20,Fpeople stay in Torbay contributing     
OL,21,F#30m to the local economy.             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
